    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>投资人更青睐哪种人格模型？创业过程中，你见过哪些反常识、离经叛道的见解？在wteam执行总裁万瑶主持下，盛景嘉成基金合伙人颜艳春、Chimer AI 创始人黄祯、00后创业者李立峰、00后投资人麦家宇等创投代表展开了一场跨时代圆桌对谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>颜艳春：走出耐克曲线有两种人格模型</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>MBTI创业版：投资人更青睐哪种人格模型？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a> 麦佳宇：逆势者和深思者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>共识与非共识：创业的独特认知</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 麦佳宇：中国年轻人可以打破硅谷神话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 黄祯：年轻一代将重塑需求市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a> 李立峰：直接投入SaaS？并不明智</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 颜艳春：“智业文明时代”下，2C和2B市场哪个更有潜力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>文字版已整理至公众号：wteam官方号</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2LMmkwTogwJ_RKhcovoc9RlKpX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这里是全国大学生CEO浓度最高的wteam！感谢您的收听！</span></p>]]></description>
